{"id":"n40095-1-10","stage":2,"title":"노랑 · 黄","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40095-1-10-1","ko":"노랑 병아리들 참 예쁘지?","zh":"那些黄色的小鸡真漂亮，对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"노랑","meaning":"黄","explanation":"노랑：黄","readings":[{"term":"노랑","audio":"/audio/abfa58fa6970af91e0a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40095","senseId":"1","lemma":"노랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"병아리들","meaning":"雏鸡，小鸡","explanation":"병아리：雏鸡，小鸡；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"병아리","audio":"/audio/04513e84ecfd8f762231.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14484","senseId":"1","lemma":"병아리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예쁘지?","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"abfa58fa6970af91","term":"노랑","zh":"黄","audio":"/audio/abfa58fa6970af91e0a0.mp3","entryId":"40095","definition":"和香蕉或柠檬一样的颜色。","pronunciation":["노랑"]},{"id":"04513e84ecfd8f76","term":"병아리","zh":"雏鸡，小鸡","audio":"/audio/04513e84ecfd8f762231.mp3","entryId":"14484","definition":"还没长大的小鸡。","pronunciation":["병아리"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe9f72e6dc81c9a000d5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40095-1-10-2","ko":"응. 색이 노란 것이 참 귀엽네.","zh":"嗯，黄色的确实很可爱呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"색이","meaning":"色，色彩","explanation":"색：色，色彩；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"색","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20231","senseId":"1","lemma":"색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노란","meaning":"黄色的","explanation":"노랗다：黄色的；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"노랗다","audio":"/audio/c4c95c7fd5963a0fffee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40101","senseId":"1","lemma":"노랗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것이","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"귀엽네.","meaning":"可爱","explanation":"귀엽다：可爱；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"귀엽다","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38323","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀엽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"4e0f2a64814ac0cd","term":"색","zh":"色，色彩","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3","entryId":"20231","definition":"物体吸收光后表现出的明暗或红、黄、蓝等颜色。","pronunciation":["색"]},{"id":"c4c95c7fd5963a0f","term":"노랗다","zh":"黄色的","audio":"/audio/c4c95c7fd5963a0fffee.mp3","entryId":"40101","definition":"和香蕉或柠檬相同的颜色。","pronunciation":["노ː라타"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行